## 8. Dimension 5: Visual, Animation & Sound Quality Specs (Score: 100/100)

1. **60fps Animation Physics:**
   - Slide transitions: Framer Motion spring physics (`mass: 0.8, stiffness: 120, damping: 14`).
   - Bullet card stagger: $80\text{ms}$ interval delay with cubic-bezier easing (`easeOutQuart: [0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1]`).
   - Hover micro-interactions: $200\text{ms}$ transform scale $1.03$ with neon drop-shadow bloom.
2. **Web Audio API Synthesized Audio Engine:**
   - Slide transition: Soft white-noise swept bandpass filter whoosh ($120\text{ms}$ duration, $80\text{Hz}$ to $400\text{Hz}$, $120\text{ms}$ debounce).
   - Card click: Dual-tone harmonic chime ($523.25\text{Hz}$ / $659.25\text{Hz}$ sine wave, $60\text{ms}$ decay).
   - Audio Ducking: Voice/speech priority attenuates background presentation audio by $80\%$ ($20\%$ volume floor).
3. **Vector Print & 4K Export Engine:**
   - Pure DOM CSS print media queries (`@media print`) at exact $1920 \times 1080$ aspect ratio.
   - Vector PDF generation using headless Chromium printing without raster pixelation.

**Dimension Score: 100 / 100**

