## 9. Dimension 6: Mathematical & Algorithmic Determinism (Score: 100/100)

The specification avoids subjective aesthetic terms ("modern", "clean") in favor of mathematical formulas:
1. **10-Step Gradient Power Law:**
   $$L(i) = L_{\text{base}} + (L_{\text{target}} - L_{\text{base}}) \times \left(\frac{i}{N - 1}\right)^\gamma$$
   $$C(i) = C_{\text{base}} \times \left(1 - \left(\frac{i}{N - 1}\right)^\alpha\right)$$
   Where $N = 10$, $\gamma = 1.15$, $\alpha = 0.85$.
2. **Character-Level Gradient Interpolation:**
   $$t_k = \frac{k}{L - 1}, \quad \text{StepIndex}(k) = \text{round}\left(S_{\text{start}} + (S_{\text{end}} - S_{\text{start}}) \times t_k\right)$$
3. **SVG Wave Cubic Bezier Coordinates:**
   $$\text{Layer 1 Base:} \quad M(0, 940) \to C(480, 880), (960, 990), (1440, 920) \to T(1920, 950) \to L(1920, 1080) \to L(0, 1080) Z$$
   $$\text{Layer 2 Ribbon:} \quad M(0, 960) \to C(420, 910), (920, 1020), (1400, 940) \to T(1920, 970) \to L(1920, 1080) \to L(0, 1080) Z$$

**Dimension Score: 100 / 100**

